## Project PLATEAU source data

Building CityGML datasets are sourced from Project PLATEAU (プロジェクト PLATEAU),
a national digital twin initiative by the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure,
Transport and Tourism (国土交通省, MLIT).

**Attribution required:**

> 国土交通省 Project PLATEAU
> https://www.mlit.go.jp/plateau/

Datasets are published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0) license unless otherwise specified in the dataset catalog.

Source data is NOT included in this repository. Download scripts are provided
under `scripts/fetch.sh`. See `data/input-manifest.yml` for dataset details.

